    "description": "When a SLC is marked as Review Required, if the Player Record has been created as part of the process, the No Player Found Error should not be displayed in the Review Reason. \n\nIn the [SLC Report ](https://nosoftware-nosoftware-7430--partialsb.sandbox.lightning.force.com/lightning/r/Report/00OWJ000003gnSP2AY/view?queryScope=userFolders)below the Player Records were created for all SLC clicks even if the SLC click was flagged for Review due to missing deal or DRA. However the \"No Player Found\" error in the Review reason is misleading. If the SLC is reprocessed without fixing any deal/dra issues, the No Player Found error disappears (ex. SLC-00251) \n\nInstead of No Player Found, there should only be a player related error if no Player could be created with the player info received with the SLC or if none could be found when a Player External Id is included in the SLC.",
